{"version": "0.4", "title": "Entrance submission", "type": "page", "page_settings": [], "content": [{"id": "6943f5c", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "b4ca8a5", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "6aa65b5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-nav\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-block:1.1rem;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n  <a href=\"/\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/ise-ul-logo.png\" alt=\"Immersive Software Engineering · University of Limerick\" style=\"height:40px;width:auto;\"></a>\n  <nav style=\"display:flex;gap:1.6rem;align-items:center;font-weight:500;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <a href=\"/students\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">The Students</a><a href=\"/companies\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">The Companies</a><a href=\"/course\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">Course</a><a href=\"/jobs\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">Jobs</a><a href=\"/about\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">About</a><a href=\"/become-a-partner\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">For partners</a>\n    <a class=\"ise-btn ise-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.ul.ie/study/undergraduate/immersive-software-engineering-bsc-or-msc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding:.55rem 1.05rem;background:var(--ul-green-modern);color:#04231a;\">Apply · LM173</a>\n  </nav>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "cd2f2f8", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "bffa5e4", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "6a437c1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-hero\" style=\"background:#0a3f2c;padding-block:0;\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\" style=\"min-height:clamp(440px,58vh,560px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding-block:5rem 4rem;\">\n  <p class=\"ise-eyebrow\" style=\"color:#8fe3b0;\">Applying</p>\n  <h1 style=\"color:#fff;font-size:var(--fs-h1);margin:.5rem 0 1.1rem;max-width:18ch;\">The ISE entrance submission</h1>\n  <p style=\"font-size:var(--fs-lead);color:#e7f2ec;max-width:60ch;\">ISE looks beyond points. Alongside your CAO application you complete an entrance submission, worth up to 200 points, so we can see how you think and build.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.75rem;\"><a class=\"ise-btn ise-btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.software-engineering.ie/about-the-ise-entrance-submission/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read the full brief</a></div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "7605166", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "61d3341", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "aaa525c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-band\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:58ch;margin-bottom:2rem;\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\">How it works</p><h2>Two routes, one submission</h2>\n  <p class=\"ise-lead\">Choose one of two routes. Both carry equal marks and are worth up to 200 points. Pick the one that lets you best show your skills and interests in science, technology, engineering, maths and innovation.</p></div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.5rem;\">\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Route A · Technology Project</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Up to 800 words on a project where you used technology to do something interesting. Tell us what you did and, just as important, how you did it. Add screenshots, links to repositories or sites, and short explained code fragments, plus the impact of the work and what you would do differently.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Route B · Personal Profile</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Answer three of four set questions, up to 400 words each, with one optional supporting link per answer. This route suits applicants with or without hands-on software experience and lets you showcase achievements and identity beyond grades.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "866499f", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "1b7678d", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "1ffae17", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:2rem;\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\">Who and how</p><h2>Applying and getting access</h2></div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;\">\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Who it is for</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">CAO (Leaving Certificate), mature and international applicants to Immersive Software Engineering, CAO code LM173.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Getting the portal link</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Select LM173 on your CAO application and you will be emailed a link to the submission portal. International applicants apply directly to UL and receive the same link.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Evidence is welcome</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Screenshots, repositories, portfolios, website links and commented code all help, as long as you explain them in your writing.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "bb70dbf", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "fd3e4d0", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "c166bc0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-band\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:1.5rem;\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\">Timeline</p><h2>When you will hear from us</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"ise-faq\" style=\"max-width:820px;\">\n    <details open><summary>CAO application by 1 February</summary><p>You will be emailed in early to mid March with details of the entrance submission process.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>CAO application after 1 February, up to 1 May</summary><p>You will be emailed by mid May with the same details.</p></details>\n    <details><summary>CAO Change of Mind up to 1 July</summary><p>If you add LM173 through Change of Mind, you will be emailed by mid July. Dates may differ for international applicants; contact UL Admissions.</p></details>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "84f1a3f", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": tru